# Contact

Import Layout.

## Page /contact

Head:
    <title>Contact — Acme</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Say hello.">

State:
    Let note be "".
    Let sent be false.

Actions:
    To send:
        Set sent to true.

View:
    {extends Site}
    {block content:}
      <h1>Contact</h1>
      {if sent:}
        <p id="thanks">Thank you — we will write back.</p>
      {else:}
        <form id="say" on-submit.prevent={send}>
          <label for="note">Your message</label>
          <input id="note" type="text" bind={note}>
          <button type="submit">Send</button>
        </form>
      {end}
    {end}

## Test: a message is sent and thanked, with Contact the active link

Type "hello" into "#note".
Submit "#say".
Expect that the text of "#thanks" is equal to "Thank you — we will write back.".
Expect that the count of "#say" is equal to 0.
Expect that the count of "nav a" is equal to 4.
Expect that the count of "nav a.active" is equal to 1.
Expect that the text of "nav a.active" is equal to "Contact".

## Test: the form is there until something is sent

Expect that the count of "#say" is equal to 1.
Expect that the count of "#thanks" is equal to 0.
